     properly attributed.

3.4  **Personal Experimentation**: You may modify the Software for your own
     personal experimentation and learning, provided that such modifications
     are not Distributed and do not infringe upon any third-party rights.

3.5  **Security Research**: You may conduct security research on the Software
     following responsible disclosure practices as outlined in Section 58,
     provided that such research is conducted ethically and legally.

3.6  **Bug Reporting**: You may report bugs, vulnerabilities, or issues to
