     (e) Making available through network services, APIs, or downloads

4.2  **No Commercial Use**: You shall not use the Software for any Commercial
     Use, including but not limited to:
     (a) Selling, licensing, or sublicensing the Software or Derivative Works
     (b) Using the Software to provide paid services or consulting
