     (b) Developing tools to bypass or circumvent anti-cheat systems
     (c) Creating software that violates the terms of service of any game
         or online service
     (d) Distributing or promoting cheat clients, hacks, or exploits

4.5  **No Reverse Engineering for Competition**: You shall not reverse engineer,
     decompile, or disassemble the Software for the purpose of creating
     competing products or services.

4.6  **No Removal of Notices**: You shall not remove, alter, or obscure any
     copyright notices, trademark notices, license notices, or other
     proprietary markings from the Software.

4.7  **No Circumvention**: You shall not circumvent any technical measures
     implemented in the Software to control access, use, or copying.

4.8  **No Automated Access**: You shall not use automated means to access,
